# install.sh's backup convention, shared with the bazzite repo's
# `just link-dotfiles`. These land in $HOME rather than here, but the pattern is
# kept so a stray copy made inside the repo never gets committed.
*.bak-*

# Editor and OS droppings. .DS_Store earns its place here specifically because
# this repo is meant to be checked out on a Mac.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Karabiner-Elements churn: ~/.config/karabiner is a directory symlink into this
# repo (install.sh's config_dir_links), so everything Karabiner writes lands in
# the working tree. These are its rotated daily copies of karabiner.json, which
# is itself committed. Anchored to the one directory rather than a bare
# `automatic_backups/` so it cannot swallow a same-named directory added later.
macos/config/karabiner/automatic_backups/
